 to be all yours for the evening. Food or "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["fun, either way the best are always the squealers."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Lion6", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Sometimes you'll come across a particularly cute "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["morsel and give them the 'special treatment', "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["expanding your pride in a single night."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Lion45", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Most of the time, especially when your rear burns "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["with heat, you have to do it the old fashioned "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["way. Rubbing up against your, mostly, worthless "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["mate, degrading yourself like an animal."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Lion202", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Still, he might only be good at one thing but "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["he's very, very good at that one thing...\\."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["The day might be wasted in terms of pride care, "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["but you're both left extremely happy and content."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Lion130", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Once there's a cub growing within you however, you "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["and the other lionesses don't have to limit yourself "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["to the only compatible dick around. "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Lion274", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Luckily there are lots of much more pleasing "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["partners happy to roll in the grass with a pride "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["of beautiful, amazonian lionesses."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 2, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": [""]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\{   Ending E52 - Puffed up with Pride"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 121, "parameters": [1122, 1122, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 121, "parameters": [760, 760, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 355, "parameters": ["global_save"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 353, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 0, "parameters": []}], "moveFrequency": 3, "moveRoute": {"repeat": true, "skippable": false, "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}, "moveSpeed": 4, "moveType": 0, "priorityType": 0, "stepAnime": false, "through": false, "trigger": 0, "walkAnime": true, "image": {"tileId": 0, "characterName": "", "characterIndex": 0, "direction": 2, "pattern": 0}}, {"conditions": {"switch1Valid": false, "switch2Valid": false, "variableValid": true, "selfSwitchValid": false, "itemValid": false, "actorValid": false, "switch1Id": 1, "switch2Id": 1, "variableId": 117, "variableValue": 54, "selfSwitchCh": "A", "itemId": 1, "actorId": 1}, "directionFix": false, "list": [{"indent": 0, "code": 0, "parameters": []}], "moveFrequency": 3, "moveRoute": {"repeat": true, "skippable": false, "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}, "moveSpeed": 3, "moveType": 0, "priorityType": 0, "stepAnime": false, "through": false, "trigger": 0, "walkAnime": true, "image": {"tileId": 0, "characterName": "", "charact